---
source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: clickbench_q39"
---
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |  Limit: skip=1000, fetch=10                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |   Sort: PageViews DESC NULLS FIRST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |     Projection: hits.URL, count(Int64(1)) AS PageViews                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |       Aggregate: groupBy=[[hits.URL]], aggr=[[count(Int64(1))]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |         TableScan: hits projection=[URL], full_filters=[hits.IsLink != Int64(0), hits.CounterID = Int64(62), hits.IsDownload = Int64(0), hits.IsRefresh = Int64(0), date_trunc(Utf8("day"), from_unixtime(hits.EventTime)) >= Utf8("2013-07-01"), date_trunc(Utf8("day"), from_unixtime(hits.EventTime)) <= Utf8("2013-07-31")]                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=hits compute_context=//data/hits.turso base_sql=SELECT `hits`.`URL`, count(1) AS `PageViews` FROM `hits` WHERE ((((((`hits`.`IsLink` <> 0) AND (`hits`.`CounterID` = 62)) AND (`hits`.`IsDownload` = 0)) AND (`hits`.`IsRefresh` = 0)) AND (strftime('%Y-%m-%d', datetime(`hits`.`EventTime`, 'unixepoch')) >= '2013-07-01')) AND (strftime('%Y-%m-%d', datetime(`hits`.`EventTime`, 'unixepoch')) <= '2013-07-31')) GROUP BY `hits`.`URL` ORDER BY `PageViews` DESC NULLS FIRST LIMIT 10 OFFSET 1000 |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
